  "description": "Minimize semesters to finish n courses given prerequisites and a maximum of k courses per semester.",
  "target": 3,
  "pseudocode": "1. dp = array of size 2^n filled with Infinity\n2. dp[0] = 0\n3. for mask in 0 to 2^n - 1:\n4.   if dp[mask] == Infinity: continue\n5.   available = get_courses_with_all_prereqs_met(mask)\n6.   can_take = filter_by_k(available, k)\n7.   for subset in can_take:\n8.     dp[mask | subset] = min(dp[mask | subset], dp[mask] + 1)",
